('0842055001', '0842055', 'FUNC. SB Samuel water rep TP', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Kids Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Puffer jacket in quilted, water-repellent functional fabric with reflective details. Stand-up collar, detachable, fleece-lined hood and a zip down the front with a chin guard. Side pockets with a press-stud, and covered elastication at the cuffs. Rounded and longer at the back. Partly lined in fleece. The jacket has a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
