('0842069002', '0842069', 'BB Frans Parka TP', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded parka in sturdy fabric with a stand-up collar and detachable, faux shearling-lined hood with a faux fur trim. Concealed zip down the front with a wind flap and visible buttons. Handwarmer pockets with a press-stud, patch front pockets with a flap and button, a zipped sleeve pocket and inner ribbing at the cuffs. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0842069003', '0842069', 'BB Frans Parka TP', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Medium Dusty', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded parka in sturdy fabric with a stand-up collar and detachable, faux shearling-lined hood with a faux fur trim. Concealed zip down the front with a wind flap and visible buttons. Handwarmer pockets with a press-stud, patch front pockets with a flap and button, a zipped sleeve pocket and inner ribbing at the cuffs. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0842069005', '0842069', 'BB Frans Parka TP', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded parka in sturdy fabric with a stand-up collar and detachable, faux shearling-lined hood with a faux fur trim. Concealed zip down the front with a wind flap and visible buttons. Handwarmer pockets with a press-stud, patch front pockets with a flap and button, a zipped sleeve pocket and inner ribbing at the cuffs. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0842070001', '0842070', 'BB FUNC Air Ski Jkt', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Greenish Khaki', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded ski jacket in windproof, water-repellent, breathable functional fabric with folded seams and reflective details. Detachable, lined hood, stand-up collar and zip down the front with a chin guard. Adjustable hook and loop tab and jersey inner ribbing with thumbholes at the cuffs. Flap patch pockets with a press-stud and a zipped lift pass pocket on one sleeve. Snow flap with press-studs at the waist. Fleece lining. The jacket has a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons. Lining and filling in recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0842070003', '0842070', 'BB FUNC Air Ski Jkt', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Colour blocking', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded ski jacket in windproof, water-repellent, breathable functional fabric with folded seams and reflective details. Detachable, lined hood, stand-up collar and zip down the front with a chin guard. Adjustable hook and loop tab and jersey inner ribbing with thumbholes at the cuffs. Flap patch pockets with a press-stud and a zipped lift pass pocket on one sleeve. Snow flap with press-studs at the waist. Fleece lining. The jacket has a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons. Lining and filling in recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0842072001', '0842072', 'BB FUNC Air Ski Snow Pants', 'Outdoor trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded ski trousers in windproof, water-repellent, breathable functional fabric with closed, waterproof seams at critical points. Adjustable hook and loop tab at the sides, a zip fly and press-stud and zipped side pockets. Reinforced hems with snow flaps. Detachable, adjustable elastic braces. Lined. The trousers have a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0842112001', '0842112', 'Rio romantic tunic', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Embroidery', 'Yellow', 'Bright', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Casual', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Tunic in an airy cotton weave with embroidery at the front. Small, pompom-trimmed stand-up collar, a V-shaped opening at the front with narrow ties at the top and wide, 3/4-length sleeves with narrow elastication at the cuffs. Seam at the hips with a pompom trim and a lined, flared tier to the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
