('0842345001', '0842345', 'Blake slim linen blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Blue', 'Medium', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Jacket in airy linen with narrow notch lapels and a decorative buttonhole. One chest pocket, flap front pockets and two inner pockets. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Partly lined. Slim Fit – a fit that shapes in at the chest and tapers at the waist. This, combined with slightly narrower sleeves, creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
