('0844390001', '0844390', 'LOGG Athens wrap dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Yellow', 'Dark', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Calf-length dress in an airy Tencel™ lyocell weave with a wrapover top and sewn-on band at the waist that ties at the back. Decorative gathers on the shoulder seams and at the back of the neckline, and short, wide sleeves. Two slits at the front of the hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0);
