('0847208001', '0847208', 'OC Eleonora Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Projects Dresses', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Short dress in airy chiffon made from patterned, recycled polyester with a sweetheart neckline and flounces down the front. Open section with lacing at the back and long sleeves with elastication at the cuffs and flounces down the sides. Elasticated seam at the waist and flounces at the hem. Partly lined in jersey. The lining is made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
