('0852393001', '0852393', 'TC - ZIPPER NARROW XS', 'Zipper head', 'Garment and Shoe care', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'Metal ZlideOn zip tab to quickly repair a broken zip in your favourite garment. Can be used with metal spiral/coil zips that are 4 mm wide when closed. These zips are often found in, for example, skirts, dresses, trousers and cushion covers. Remove the old zip tab and click on the ZlideOn tab.', NULL, 0, 0),
