('0852556001', '0852556', 'CE - Anthozoa ring', 'Ring', 'Accessories', 'Glittering/Metallic', 'Gold', 'Medium', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Large ring made from recycled metal with a coral-shaped decoration.The ring is decorated with faceted glass rhinestones. Width approx. 3.5 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
