('0855803001', '0855803', 'Piper sandal', 'Sandals', 'Shoes', 'Application/3D', 'White', 'Light', 'Baby Shoes', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids & Baby Shoes', 'Shoes', 'Sandals in imitation leather with a lightly padded top edge and an ankle strap with a hook and loop fastening. Wide strap over the foot with appliqués and an adjustable hook and loop fastening. Imitation leather insoles and patterned soles.', NULL, 0, 0),
