('0858976001', '0858976', 'Saga blouse (W)', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Dark', 'Woven Tops', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Blouses', 'Blouse in a crinkled cotton weave with a unique nursing feature. Round neck, short sleeves with sewn-in turn-ups, and a rounded hem. The design includes a double layer to help retain warmth while allowing easier nursing access.', NULL, 0, 0),
