('0859961001', '0859961', 'LE Clover Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'White', 'Light', 'Limited Edition', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Long, wide dress in an airy, printed weave with a small opening and hook-and-eye fastener at the top. Gathered yoke at the back for added volume, pleats and a drawstring with narrow ties at the front, and 3/4-length trumpet sleeves with wide cuffs. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
