('0860857002', '0860857', 'Dib dab hoody', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Long-sleeved top in cotton sweatshirt fabric with a double-layered hood, dropped shoulders and long sleeves. Decorative, shaping seams at the front and back that continue down the sleeves and a rounded hem with inset ribbing at the front. Slightly longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860857003', '0860857', 'Dib dab hoody', 'Sweater', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Long-sleeved top in cotton sweatshirt fabric with a double-layered hood, dropped shoulders and long sleeves. Decorative, shaping seams at the front and back that continue down the sleeves and a rounded hem with inset ribbing at the front. Slightly longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860858001', '0860858', 'Rennie Penny Loafer', 'Other shoe', 'Shoes', 'Solid', 'Dark Orange', 'Dark', 'Shoes', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Shoes', 'Shoes', 'Leather loafers with a decorative tab and seam at the front. Leather linings and insoles. Heel approx. 2 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860867001', '0860867', 'Brody trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Trousers in jersey with a high waist, concealed zip in one side and straight, wide legs with sewn-in creases at the front and slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860867002', '0860867', 'Brody trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Medium Dusty', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Trousers in jersey with a high waist, concealed zip in one side and straight, wide legs with sewn-in creases at the front and slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860882001', '0860882', 'CE Perier knit dress OL', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Fitted, calf-length dress in a soft, fine, rib knit made from recycled polyester containing some nylon. Round neck, wide shoulder straps with decorative ties at the top, a wide ribbed section down the front and back, and a wide flounce at the hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860883001', '0860883', 'CE Elite dress OL', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Long dress in woven fabric made partly from recycled polyester. Deep V-neck front and back with narrow, padded trims and wide shoulder straps. High-cut, gathered waist with narrow, padded stitching, a zip in one side and a wide, dramatically draping, pleated skirt with an inner layer of tulle and a high slit at the front. Reinforcing grosgrain waistband with an adjustable fastening on the inside for a firmer fit around the waist. The tulle is in RENU™ polyester – a high-quality polyester made from raw material recycled from used textiles.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860884001', '0860884', 'CE Antipolis dress V6', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Long, voluminous dress in tulle made from recycled polyester with a sheen. Deep V-neck at the back with two sets of horizontal grosgrain ties that fasten at the back. The entire dress is decorated with narrow strips of ruffled tulle. Fitted at the top, a seam at the waist with a narrow grosgrain band, and a super-flared skirt with two layers of tulle for added width and stability. Concealed zip in one side. Reinforcing grosgrain waistband with an adjustable fastening on the inside for a firmer fit around the waist. Lined in organza made from RENU™ polyester – a high-quality polyester made from raw material extracted from used fabric.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860885001', '0860885', 'Felicia cord shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Casual', 'Blouses', 'Long-sleeved shirt in wide-wale corduroy with a collar, buttons down the front and a yoke with a pleat at the back. Long sleeves with buttoned cuffs, and a rounded hem. Slightly longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860885002', '0860885', 'Felicia cord shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Greenish Khaki', 'Medium Dusty', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Casual', 'Blouses', 'Long-sleeved shirt in wide-wale corduroy with a collar, buttons down the front and a yoke with a pleat at the back. Long sleeves with buttoned cuffs, and a rounded hem. Slightly longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860885003', '0860885', 'Felicia cord shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Orange', 'Light', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Casual', 'Blouses', 'Long-sleeved shirt in wide-wale corduroy with a collar, buttons down the front and a yoke with a pleat at the back. Long sleeves with buttoned cuffs, and a rounded hem. Slightly longer at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860886001', '0860886', 'CE Nice dress OL', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Sequin', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Short, straight-cut, heavily draping dress in sequined chiffon made from recycled polyester. Deep, wrapover V-neck, wide, raglan balloon sleeves and wide, loose-fitting cuffs with pleats for added volume. Chiffon lining made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860887001', '0860887', 'CE Grenille dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Tunic in taffeta with a slight sheen made from recycled polyester. Gathers around the neckline and a V-shaped opening at the front. Wide, oversized balloon sleeves with wide cuffs. Box pleat at the front for added volume and a flare to the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860888001', '0860888', 'CE Parfait dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Short dress in airy, printed, organic cotton voile. Flounce-trimmed neckline with a V-shaped opening at the front and drawstring at the top. Relaxed fit with long, voluminous sleeves, wide cuffs, pleats at the back for added volume and soft draping, a seam at the hips and a gathered hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860891001', '0860891', 'CE Cote d azur dress v6', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Short, fitted, one-shoulder dress in taffeta made from recycled polyester. Double-layered, overdimensioned, sturdy, voluminous flounces at the top, over one shoulder and on the skirt. Concealed zip in one side. Chiffon lining made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860892001', '0860892', 'CE Coco blazer OL', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Jacket in a linen and Tencel™ lyocell blend. Relaxed fit with notch lapels, shoulder pads for a defined silhouette and slits at the cuffs. Tie-front fastening, two flap front pockets, and a single back vent. Lined partly in recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860893001', '0860893', 'CE Picasso shirt', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Voluminous blouse in voile made from recycled cotton with a high, wrapover collar with a concealed fastening and decorative seams. Gathered neckline with a drawstring and a concealed opening at the front. Low dropped shoulders and wide, tapered sleeves with narrow, double-buttoned cuffs.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860894001', '0860894', 'CE Sete blouse print', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Blouse in an airy, patterned Tencel™ lyocell weave with an opening and narrow, padded trim at the top. Dropped shoulders with smocking, and wide, gathered, voluminous, tapered sleeves. Relaxed fit with a straight cut and slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860895001', '0860895', 'CE Sailor top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Stripe', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Fitted, hip-length top in a soft, airy, fine rib knit made from recycled polyester. Wide ribbed sections front and back, slim sleeves in a wide rib knit and a flounced peplum at the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860896001', '0860896', 'CE Bon bon blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Embroidery', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Slightly shorter, boxy-style blouse in textured taffeta made from recycled polyester. Wide neckline with a low-cut back, dropped shoulders and gathered, voluminous balloon sleeves with large sequined appliqués. Seam at the hem with a double-layered, flared peplum.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860897001', '0860897', 'CE avignon strap top', 'Vest top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Top in matt satin made from a silk and Tencel™ lyocell blend with wide, tie-top shoulder straps in a contrasting colour and a V-neck. Opening with a covered button at the back and slits in the sides. Lined at the top. The top is dyed in a natural, sustainable way using coffee.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860898002', '0860898', 'CE Molinard top', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Fitted, one-shoulder top in satin made partly from recycled polyester and tulle in RENU™ polyester. Layers of large tulle flounces at the top and a tulle-covered bodice with a concealed zip in one side. RENU™ polyester is a high-quality polyester made from raw material recycled from used textiles.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860901001', '0860901', 'CE Toulon denim', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Light Orange', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. 5-pocket jeans in undyed organic cotton denim. Relaxed fit with a high waist, button fly with matt, gold-coloured metal buttons and straight, ankle-length legs. Manufactured sustainably without toxic chemicals or unnecessary water wastage using cotton grown without the use of artificial fertilisers or pesticides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860902001', '0860902', 'CE Bateau trousers', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Stripe', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Ankle-length trousers in a soft, airy, fine rib knit made from recycled polyester. Regular waist with covered elastication, and straight legs with flounced hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0860904001', '0860904', 'CE Cannes skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Flared, knee-length skirt in tulle made from RENU™ polyester with decorative grosgrain horizontal trims. Regular waist with a grosgrain waistband and concealed zip in one side with a hook-and-eye fastening. Gathers at the top and two extra layers of tulle for width and stability. Chiffon lining made from recycled polyester. RENU™ polyester is a high-quality polyester made from raw material recycled from used textiles.', NULL, 0, 0),
