('0862336001', '0862336', 'OPEN WALLET TYPE', 'Wallet', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Other Accessories', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Accessories', 'Accessories', 'Small purse in grained imitation patent leather with a tab and press-stud fastening. Six card compartments, one with a transparent plastic window, a note compartment at one side and a zipped outer compartment. Length approx. 10.5 cm. Height approx. 9 cm. Lined in taffeta made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862340001', '0862340', 'Lily utility HW', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Trouser', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Trousers', 'Trousers in a cotton weave. High paper bag waist with pleats at the front, covered elastication at the back and a tie belt. Zip fly with concealed hook-and-eye fasteners, front pockets and wide, gently tapered, loose-fitting legs with flap pockets.', NULL, 0, 0),
