('0862368003', '0862368', 'SAGA HOOD', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Young Girl Jersey Basic', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Girls Underwear & Basics', 'Jersey Basic', 'Zip-through hoodie in soft sweatshirt fabric with a brushed inside. Jersey-lined hood, zip down the front, dropped shoulders, long sleeves and ribbing at the cuffs and hem. The cotton content of the hoodie is organic.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862368008', '0862368', 'SAGA HOOD(1)', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Greenish Khaki', 'Medium Dusty', 'Young Girl Jersey Basic', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Girls Underwear & Basics', 'Jersey Basic', 'Zip-through hoodie in soft sweatshirt fabric with a brushed inside. Jersey-lined hood, zip down the front, dropped shoulders, long sleeves and ribbing at the cuffs and hem. The cotton content of the hoodie is organic.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862379002', '0862379', 'Distraction seamless bra', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Ladies Sport Bras', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Jersey Fancy', 'One-shoulder sports bra in ribbed microfibre with one wide shoulder strap and wide ribbing at the hem. Light support. The bra is designed with the minimum number of seams for a more comfortable fit and increased mobility.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862379003', '0862379', 'Distraction seamless bra', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Medium Dusty', 'Ladies Sport Bras', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Jersey Fancy', 'One-shoulder sports bra in ribbed microfibre with one wide shoulder strap and wide ribbing at the hem. Light support. The bra is designed with the minimum number of seams for a more comfortable fit and increased mobility.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862379006', '0862379', 'Distraction seamless bra', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Light Purple', 'Dusty Light', 'Ladies Sport Bras', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Jersey Fancy', 'One-shoulder sports bra in ribbed microfibre with one wide shoulder strap and wide ribbing at the hem. Light support. The bra is designed with the minimum number of seams for a more comfortable fit and increased mobility.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862380001', '0862380', 'Serena Tennis Skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Ladies Sport Bottoms', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Short skirt in lightweight, fast-drying functional fabric with short inner tights. The skirt has an elasticated waist and pleats for added mobility and a laser-cut hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862385001', '0862385', 'CE Bandol tee OL', 'T-shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Classic T-shirt in soft, organic cotton jersey with a round neckline and short slits in the sides.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862386002', '0862386', 'CE Biaritz dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Short dress in organic linen with a voluminous bodice. Deep V-neck with pleats either side, a wrapover top, and smocking details on the shoulders and under the bust. Long balloon sleeves with pleats for added volume and narrow, covered elastication at the cuffs. Richly detailed back with an opening and pleats, a seam at the waist, a concealed zip in one side and a fitted skirt. Lined in an organic cotton weave.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862393001', '0862393', 'CE La pausa trs OL', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Trousers in a linen and Tencel™ lyocell blend with a high waist, concealed hook-and-eye fasteners and zip fly. Side pockets and a jetted back pocket. Close-fitting at the top with pleats, relaxing at the hips into wide, straight legs with creases.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862396001', '0862396', 'CE Riviera skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Mini skirt in taffeta made from recycled polyester with a draped effect. Large, gathered flounces with overlocked edges down one side and a concealed zip with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener. Lined in chiffon made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862398001', '0862398', 'CE Sable bikini bottom', 'Swimwear bottom', 'Swimwear', 'All over pattern', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Fully lined bikini bottoms in fabric made from an Econyl® blend with a high waist, wide sides and medium coverage at the back. Lined partly in recycled polyester. Econyl® is nylon made from recycled fibres from fishing nets and other nylon waste, reducing impact on the climate and contributing to cleaner oceans.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862399001', '0862399', 'CE L''eau swimsuit OL', 'Swimsuit', 'Swimwear', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Fully lined swimsuit in mosaic-patterned fabric made from an Econyl® blend with a V-neck and narrow, adjustable shoulder straps that can be fastened in various ways. Econyl® is nylon made from recycled fibres from fishing nets and other nylon waste, reducing impact on the climate and contributing to cleaner oceans.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862414001', '0862414', 'Martine flower', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'All over pattern', 'Pink', 'Bright', 'Skirt', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Skirts', 'Flared, calf-length skirt in a patterned cotton weave with a high waist and concealed zip in one side. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862416001', '0862416', 'LOGG mini Linus skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'All over pattern', 'Red', 'Bright', 'Kids Girl Dresses', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Girl', 'Dresses/Skirts girls', 'Skirt in an airy, patterned cotton weave with a smocked waist. Cotton lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862425001', '0862425', 'Lockhart 4PCS set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Melange', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Boy Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Boy', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Set with a waistcoat, pair of shorts and matching shirt in a cotton weave and a pre-tied bow tie in a linen and cotton weave. Lined waistcoat with buttons at the front. Knee-length shorts with an adjustable, elasticated waist, zip fly and button, and fake diagonal side pockets. Shirt with a turn-down collar, buttons down the front, short sleeves with sewn-in turn-ups, and a rounded hem. Bow tie with an adjustable elastic strap and a plastic fastener at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862427001', '0862427', 'J Swan', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Dot', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Wide, knee-length dress in mesh with a flock print. Round neckline, a small opening at the back with a button at the back of the neck, and long puff sleeves with smocking and a small frill trim at the cuffs. Gathered seam at the waist and hem for added width and soft draping. V-neck underdress in jersey with narrow shoulder straps.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862431001', '0862431', 'Coolio slim fit coolmax blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Light Grey', 'Medium Dusty', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in woven fabric containing some wool with narrow notch lapels, a chest pocket, flap welt front pockets, and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs, and a single back vent. Lined. The jacket is made from COOLMAX® functional fabric, a unique, soft, comfortable and fast-drying polyester fibre that efficiently wicks moisture while regulating temperature. Slim Fit – a fit that shapes in at the chest and tapers at the waist. This, combined with slightly narrower sleeves, creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862433001', '0862433', 'Coolio slim fit coolmax trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Melange', 'Light Grey', 'Medium Dusty', 'Trouser S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Ankle-length suit trousers in woven fabric containing some wool. Low waist with covered elastication, a zip fly with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener, diagonal side pockets and welt back pockets. Legs with creases down the front and turn-ups at the hems. The trousers are made from COOLMAX® functional fabric, a unique, soft, comfortable and fast-drying polyester fibre that efficiently wicks moisture while regulating temperature. Slim Fit – a fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0862439001', '0862439', 'Trudy Cardigan', 'Cardigan', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Projects Jersey & Knitwear', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Short, fitted cardigan in a fine knit with a V-neck, buttons down the front and overlocked edges at the cuffs and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
