('0867461001', '0867461', 'Andy skinny blz check', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Check', 'Greyish Beige', 'Dark', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a stretch weave with narrow notch lapels and a decorative buttonhole. Chest pocket, flap front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lining in satin made from recycled polyester. Skinny Fit – a slightly shorter style that shapes in at the chest and tapers sharply at the waist. This, combined with narrow shoulders and sleeves, creates a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0867461003', '0867461', 'Andy skinny blz check', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Check', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a stretch weave with narrow notch lapels and a decorative buttonhole. Chest pocket, flap front pockets and three inner pockets, one with a button. Two buttons at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lining in satin made from recycled polyester. Skinny Fit – a slightly shorter style that shapes in at the chest and tapers sharply at the waist. This, combined with narrow shoulders and sleeves, creates a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0867463001', '0867463', 'Andy skinny trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Check', 'Greyish Beige', 'Dark', 'Trouser S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in a stretch weave with a zip fly and extended waistband with hook-and-eye fasteners. Diagonal side pockets, and jetted back pockets with a button. Skinny Fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0867463003', '0867463', 'Andy skinny trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Check', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Trouser S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in a stretch weave with a zip fly and extended waistband with hook-and-eye fasteners. Diagonal side pockets, and jetted back pockets with a button. Skinny Fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0);
