('0871852002', '0871852', 'LOGG Stella ss blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Straight-cut, short-sleeved blouse in an airy cotton weave with a V-neck opening at the top and small stand-up collar with gathers and ties at the front.', NULL, 0, 0),
