('0876423002', '0876423', 'Perrie Party HW mom dnm', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Denim', 'Light Blue', 'Dusty Light', 'Trousers', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Trousers', '5-pocket, ankle-length jeans in washed denim made partly from recycled cotton decorated with rhinestones. Slightly looser fit with an extra-high waist and straight legs.', NULL, 0, 0),
