('0876461001', '0876461', 'Sugar dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Dot', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Long dress in billowing organza with a double-layered stand-up collar and opening with covered buttons at the back of the neck. Voluminous, elbow-length balloon sleeves in a double layer with a shorter inner layer that has concealed elastication to create added volume in the sleeves. Relaxed fit with a seam at the knees and a wide, flounced hem. Detachable, short underdress in a viscose weave with adjustable spaghetti shoulder straps. The polyester content of the dress is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0876461002', '0876461', 'Sugar dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Green', 'Medium', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Long dress in billowing organza with a double-layered stand-up collar and opening with covered buttons at the back of the neck. Voluminous, elbow-length balloon sleeves in a double layer with a shorter inner layer that has concealed elastication to create added volume in the sleeves. Relaxed fit with a seam at the knees and a wide, flounced hem. Detachable, short underdress in a viscose weave with adjustable spaghetti shoulder straps. The polyester content of the dress is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0876471001', '0876471', 'Dungaree LL 79', 'Dungarees', 'Garment Full body', 'Denim', 'Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Kids Boy Denim', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Boy', 'Trousers Denim', 'Dungarees in stretch, flexible denim for maximum comfort. Classic fit with press-studs at the sides, adjustable straps with metal fasteners and straight legs. Chest pocket, front and back pockets and an additional pocket on one leg. The cotton content of the dungarees is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0876472001', '0876472', 'Grad Morgan Blazer', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Projects Woven Tops', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Projects', 'Blouses', 'Jacket in woven fabric with notch lapels, buttons down the front and patch front pockets. Detachable D-ring belt at the waist and a single back vent. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0876487002', '0876487', 'Day dreamer', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Wide, calf-length dress in airy, crinkled fabric made partly from recycled polyester. Flounce around the neckline and down the front and a V-shaped opening with narrow ties at the neckline. Dropped shoulders, long, wide sleeves with a drawstring and frill trim at the cuffs, and gathered seams creating tiers at the waist and hem for added width. Sewn-in, V-neck underdress in jersey with adjustable shoulder straps. The polyester content of the underdress is recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0876525001', '0876525', 'GINNY ORGANZA', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Transparent', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Tops Woven', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Blouses', 'Straight-cut, short-sleeved shirt in organza with a collar, buttons down the front and a yoke at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
