('0876534002', '0876534', 'BB Daniel Knitted Fleece', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Jacket knitted in soft, thermal fleece with a hood, zip down the front with a chin guard, and kangaroo pockets. Jersey trim around the hood, pockets, cuffs and hem. The jacket is made partly from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
