('0876539001', '0876539', 'PARTY set', 'Hair clip', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Light Purple', 'Light', 'Girls Small Acc/Bags', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Accessories, Swimwear & D', 'Accessories', 'Set with two hair clips, a hair grip, a ring and a necklace with appliqués. Hair clips with plastic beads. Hair grip with sparkly stones. Adjustable ring with a faceted decoration. Narrow metal chain necklace with star-shaped pendants and an adjustable length 40.5-46 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
