('0880700001', '0880700', 'POW Romantica Dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Short, wide dress in patterned chiffon with a mandarin collar, opening at the top and ties at the neckline. Gathered yoke at the back, long puff sleeves and cuffs with covered buttons. Gathered seam at the waist and hem with a wide flounced trim. Satin lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0880705001', '0880705', 'Soprano dress', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Green', 'Bright', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Long, flared dress in an airy weave with a double-layered, stand-up collar, long ties at the back of the neck and an opening at the back. Voluminous, elbow-length sleeves, and seams at the waist and hips for added width. V-neck underdress in woven fabric with adjustable shoulder straps. The polyester content of the dress is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
