('0880706005', '0880706', 'Potter lace shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Lace', 'White', 'Light', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Oversized lace shirt with a pointed collar and buttons down the front. Low dropped shoulders, long sleeves with buttoned cuffs, two open chest pockets, and a rounded hem. Longer at the back. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
