('0880729001', '0880729', 'Annabell top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Jacquard', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Blouses', 'Round-necked top in an airy brocade weave with a shimmering gold-coloured pattern. Hook-and-eye fastener at the back of the neck, a concealed zip at the back and short, voluminous puff sleeves with narrow, concealed elastication. Pleat at the wait to create a fitted silhouette. Partly lined in satin.', NULL, 0, 0),
