('0885410001', '0885410', 'LOGG Maya dress', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Yellow', 'Dusty Light', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Knee-length dress in an airy cotton and viscose weave with a small, frilled collar and a V-shaped opening with ties at the neckline. Short, wide raglan sleeves and gathered tiers to the hem for added width. V-neck underdress with adjustable shoulder straps.', NULL, 0, 0),
